WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.660
Do not read this as a corporate hierarchy.

2
00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:07.665
RISC-V International is a separate standards organisation, not OpenHW’s parent.

3
00:00:07.665 --> 00:00:12.542
Eclipse hosts the OpenHW working group and supplies its governance framework.

4
00:00:12.542 --> 00:00:17.229
Members coordinate strategy, investment, roadmaps, and engineering policy.

5
00:00:17.229 --> 00:00:21.093
Project communities build artifacts under project governance.

6
00:00:21.093 --> 00:00:24.197
CORE-V is a portfolio label, not an organisation.

7
00:00:24.197 --> 00:00:31.925
Use RISC-V sources for ISA meaning, the charter for governance, and project docs and releases for implementation behavior.

